+## Conduct rules and why they exist
.loop/driver.log:6215: trailing whitespace.
+
.loop/driver.log:6216: trailing whitespace.
+- **Evidence or it didn't pass.** A criterion counts as passed only when this
.loop/driver.log:6217: trailing whitespace.
+  iteration printed verification output demonstrating it. Models under
.loop/driver.log:6218: trailing whitespace.
+  iteration pressure drift toward optimistic summaries; verbatim output is the
.loop/driver.log:6219: trailing whitespace.
+  antidote â€” and under Engine A, the evaluator literally cannot see anything
.loop/driver.log:6220: trailing whitespace.
+  you don't print.
.loop/driver.log:6221: trailing whitespace.
+- **Never weaken the test to pass the test.** Deleting a failing assertion,
.loop/driver.log:6222: trailing whitespace.
+  loosening a tolerance, or special-casing the checker is failing the criterion
.loop/driver.log:6223: trailing whitespace.
+  plus corrupting the loop. A genuinely wrong test is the criterion-doubt
.loop/driver.log:6224: trailing whitespace.
+  hatch: pause and ask.
.loop/driver.log:6225: trailing whitespace.
+- **Out-of-scope means out-of-scope**, precisely at the moment touching it
.loop/driver.log:6226: trailing whitespace.
+  looks convenient.
.loop/driver.log:6227: trailing whitespace.
+- **Do not gold-plate.** Waived concerns are permission to ignore them;
.loop/driver.log:6228: trailing whitespace.
+  unrequested improvements consume budget and risk regressions.
.loop/driver.log:6229: trailing whitespace.
+- **One iteration, one hypothesis.** Batching five changes destroys
.loop/driver.log:6230: trailing whitespace.
+  attribution â€” you learn nothing from pass or fail. Mid-iteration
.loop/driver.log:6231: trailing whitespace.
+  discoveries become backlog items or journal notes, not scope creep.
.loop/driver.log:6232: trailing whitespace.
+- **A false status is the one unforgivable move.** Print `LOOP STATUS:
.loop/driver.log:6233: trailing whitespace.
+  converged` only when the criteria genuinely passed with evidence printed
.loop/driver.log:6234: trailing whitespace.
+  this run. Emitting a status to escape the loop corrupts every downstream
.loop/driver.log:6235: trailing whitespace.
+  decision â€” prefer `blocked` plus an honest reason.
.loop/driver.log:6236: trailing whitespace.
+- **Backlog items are append-only.** Flip `passes` with evidence; never
.loop/driver.log:6237: trailing whitespace.
+  delete or reword an item â€” removing a hard item is the checklist version
.loop/driver.log:6238: trailing whitespace.
+  of deleting a failing test.
.loop/driver.log:6239: trailing whitespace.
+- **User-facing prose in the user's language**; `.loop/` field names, JSON
.loop/driver.log:6240: trailing whitespace.
+  keys, statuses, and the `LOOP STATUS:` line stay in English as templated so
.loop/driver.log:6241: trailing whitespace.
+  scripts, evaluators, and later sessions can parse them.
